/* ELEMENT SPEC (one line per element, built exactly as listed)
// input slab sheets (3)   → BoxGeometry(0.30, 3.0, 3.0) white MeshBasic + EdgesGeometry black
// output slab sheets (N)  → BoxGeometry(T/N, 3.0, 3.0)  white MeshBasic + EdgesGeometry black, T = f(C)
// filter box              → ShapeGeometry rounded-rect RING (black, thick) + white inner fill
// block arrows (2)        → ShapeGeometry 7-point arrow RING (black outline, hollow)
// filter cubes (min(C,8)) → BoxGeometry(0.38) white + black edges, raycast targets
