Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px">Convolutional layer explorer</div>

<label style="margin-top:2px">Number of filters in bank: <b id="nfVal">96</b>
